  Code: G2
  Title: 'Target Path: up with ..'
  Summary: The player sits on an Animations child of the button. '..' is the button,
    '../Icon' a child of it, '../../Badge' a child of the stage.
  Watch: Animations (select it to play), Button, Icon, Label, Badge
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 196248837}
  - {fileID: 573185052}
  - {fileID: 1520828779}
