  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3269ab77e5738674b9fefab358f453ff, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: A6
  Title: Previewing a set with Preview On
  Summary: A set has nothing of its own to animate, so its Inspector borrows a player
    that uses it.
  Watch: Preview Me's Animations
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 32661839}
  HowTo: Select Assets/UnitTests/Animation Sets/Button Set.asset. Drag Preview Me's
    Animations into <b>Preview On</b>. Play Press from the set's Inspector. Then
    clear Preview On.
  Expect: Play animates Preview Me. With Preview On filled, step warnings check against
    that player, and the Scene view draws the set's movement gizmos on it. With it
    empty, the Play buttons have nothing to play on.
  Needs: 13
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 260
