  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: A8
  Title: Two animations with one name in a set
  Summary: If two animations in one set share a name, the second can never play,
    and the set says so.
  Watch: 
  WatchObjects: []
  HowTo: Select Assets/UnitTests/Animation Sets/Spin Set.asset and rename Wobble
    to Spin. Then Undo.
  Expect: 'A warning appears in the Console: two animations are named ''Spin'', and
    the second never runs. Undo removes the problem.'
