  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: A1
  Title: One set, many players
  Summary: Three buttons, each with a player on its Animations child using Button
    Set (Hover, Unhover, Press), and no animations of its own.
  Watch: each button's Animations
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 899910683}
  - {fileID: 51912058}
  - {fileID: 259549694}
  HowTo: 'Select one button''s Animations: the Inspector lists Shared Animations
    (Button Set), greyed out, with a Play row for each. Play Press on each. In play
    mode, hover and click the buttons.'
  Expect: Each button only animates itself, though they share one set. Shared steps
    can be opened but not edited; right-click offers only Copy and Override.
