  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: A5
  Title: Save as Animation Set
  Summary: 'The Card''s player drives its slots by reference: the card, its icon,
    the second of two circles both named Twin, and a heart outside the card.'
  Watch: Card's Animations
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1661533079}
  HowTo: "Select Card's Animations. Right-click the Animations list \u2192 <b>Save
    as Animation Set\u2026</b> and save it into Assets/UnitTests/Animation Sets/_Scratch.
    Open the new set. Delete it when done."
  Expect: 'The set''s Pop has paths ''..'' (card) and ''../Icon'', and ''../../Elsewhere''
    for the heart (up to the stage, then down). The second Twin can''t be reached
    by name: the Console lists it, and that step warns. Notify''s On Complete was
    left out, since it pointed at a scene object. The player itself is unchanged.'
  Needs: 20
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
