  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: A7
  Title: Players sharing a set don't interfere
  Summary: Two players, one Spin Set. Each takes its own copy of the set at start-up.
  Watch: One, Two
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1197166432}
  - {fileID: 774117078}
  HowTo: 'In play mode: Spin One, then Spin Two straight after; Wobble One while
    Two spins. While playing, change Spin''s Duration in Spin Set.asset to 5 and
    Spin One again; undo it afterwards.'
  Expect: Each spins and wobbles on its own, never stopping or moving the other.
    The Duration change doesn't reach players already running (it shows next time
    you enter play mode).
  Needs: 2
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 260
